    "A latent metal vector is only estimable from ligands measured against more than one metal. The coverage numbers here are the binding constraint, not the factoriser.",
    "The singular-value spectrum is computed after filling missing cells with zero (no metal-specific offset). The number of filled cells is reported; the spectrum is descriptive, not a decomposition of measured variation.",
